two types of mode 
1.command mode
2.insert mode

press i for insert mode 
to move from insert mode to command mode press esc button

in command mode 
 press h to move cursor to left side
 press l to move cursor to right side 
 press j to move cursor to downward 
 press k to move cursor to upwward 
 
 
 in insertion mode 
 a insertion begin after the cursor
 A insertion begin at end of line
 o for new line below cursor
 O new line above cursor
 
 
 
 for copy go to command mode 
 press yy for copy 
 press p for paste
 
 
 for save the content go to command mode
 :w to save the file
 
 :w abc.txt  -> to save with file name
 
 :q to quit the file
 
 if done any changes in file but dont want to save the changes and want to quit then
 :q!
 
 :wq -> to save the changes and quit
 
